{"3635280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Offered You the Crown", "steam_appid": 3635280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I OFFERED YOU THE CROWN is a drama/comedy visual novel about surviving a cataclysmic blizzard while deciding whether you should keep dating that person you're not sure you should keep dating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serious, cynical Amy, her clownish boyfriend Teddy, and their friends Craig, Leah, and Jack are trapped in a remote, deserted mansion during a colossal snowstorm. To survive, Amy must fight the elements, struggle with her gnawing doubts about Teddy, grapple with her secret attraction to Jack, match wits with a mysterious host who prevents their escape, and decide who - if anyone - to trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I OFFERED YOU THE CROWN is primarily a linear story with a major choice that determines Amy's ending. What will be her fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original artwork by Studio Abiboge and Kimberly Wilson.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I OFFERED YOU THE CROWN is a drama/comedy visual novel about surviving a cataclysmic blizzard while deciding whether you should keep dating that person you're not sure you should keep dating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serious, cynical Amy, her clownish boyfriend Teddy, and their friends Craig, Leah, and Jack are trapped in a remote, deserted mansion during a colossal snowstorm. To survive, Amy must fight the elements, struggle with her gnawing doubts about Teddy, grapple with her secret attraction to Jack, match wits with a mysterious host who prevents their escape, and decide who - if anyone - to trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I OFFERED YOU THE CROWN is primarily a linear story with a major choice that determines Amy's ending. What will be her fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original artwork by Studio Abiboge and Kimberly Wilson.</p>", "short_description": "A drama/comedy visual novel about how holding a relationship together and surviving a deadly blizzard may not be all that different.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635280/85dbf2318791a26ea1b618cb820456b7f5082aba/header.jpg?t=1752692432", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635280/0934edfccfadfbaf74b10e3ab29e343555712684/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752692432", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635280/0934edfccfadfbaf74b10e3ab29e343555712684/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752692432", "website": "http://wintertwilightproductions.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 423 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "I OFFERED YOU THE CROWN is a work of fiction. The copyrights in this work including all characters and story are owned by Winter Twilight Productions, LLC. All rights reserved. Any similarity to persons living or dead is purely coincidental. This game includes flashing imagery that may affect photosensitive viewers. I OFFERED YOU THE CROWN contains some coarse language and contains mention of mature content such as characters discussing sexual assault. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo personal data shared with us will be given to any third party, under any circumstances. Your data will also never be used by us for any purpose without specific permission. The app engages in no ad targeting, data mining, or other activities that may compromise you